"<strong>Wire at an angle to B.</strong> At {#}° the force halves ({#} mN); at {#}° it vanishes.",
"<strong>Loop: torque.</strong> {#} turns, {#} A, {#} cm × {#} cm, {#} T: μ = {#} mA·m², largest torque {#} mN·m. Release it: it swings about μ ∥ B and settles, like a compass needle.",
"<strong>DC motor.</strong> With the commutator it keeps turning. Watch the torque readout rise and fall twice per turn.",
